---
title: Loan application life-cycle
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING : Customer - Apply for a Loan
    PENDING --> ASSIGNED : Manager - Assign to Employee
    ASSIGNED --> ASSIGNED : Manager - re-assign
    ASSIGNED --> UNDER_REVIEW : Employee - Process Loan Application
    UNDER_REVIEW --> APPROVED : Employee - Approve (amount credited, journaled)
    UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : Employee - Reject (reason required)
    ASSIGNED --> PENDING : Admin promotes / deactivates the employee
    UNDER_REVIEW --> PENDING : Admin promotes / deactivates the employee
    APPROVED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
